<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Lumanshu</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      background: #0a0a0a;
      color: #00ff66;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 80px 20px 50px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #00ff66;
    }
    header h1 { font-size: 2.4rem; text-shadow: 0 0 10px #00ff66; }
    header p { margin-top: 12px; color: #9dffc4; font-size: 1.1rem; }
    .cursor { animation: blink 1s infinite; }
    @keyframes blink { 50% { opacity: 0; } }
    section { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px; }
    section p { margin-bottom: 12px; }
    h2 { margin-bottom: 14px; color: #00ff66; }
    h2::before { content: "> "; }
    .card {
      border: 1px solid #00ff66;
      padding: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: #101810;
    }
    .skills span {
      display: inline-block;
      border: 1px solid #00ff66;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      margin: 4px;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
      border-top: 1px solid #00ff66;
      color: #9dffc4;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <h1>Lumanshu<span class="cursor">_</span></h1>
    <p>Class 11 Student | Founder | Coder | Cyber Security Learner</p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <p>Hello! I am Lumanshu, a 16-year-old Class 11 student. I love coding and cyber security, and I try to learn something new every day.</p>
    <p>I became a founder at the age of 14 and built my own brand. I have started two startups so far.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>My Skills</h2>
    <div class="skills">
      <span>Coding</span>
      <span>HTML</span>
      <span>CSS</span>
      <span>Entrepreneurship</span>
      <span>Cyber Security</span>
      <span>Ethical Hacking (learning)</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>My Projects</h2>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Two Startups</h3>
      <p>I founded my first company at 14 and have built two startups, including my own brand.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Jarvis Assistant</h3>
      <p>My own AI assistant, which I am working on.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>This Website</h3>
      <p>My first personal website, built with the help of Claude.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>You can add your email or social media links here later.</p>
  </section>

  <footer>
    &copy; 2026 Lumanshu
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
